  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [@storybook/addon-actions](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook) | devDependencies | patch | [`5.1.9` -> `5.1.10`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@storybook%2faddon-actions/5.1.9/5.1.10) |\n| [@storybook/html](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook) | devDependencies | patch | [`5.1.9` -> `5.1.10`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@storybook%2fhtml/5.1.9/5.1.10) |\n| [@storybook/theming](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook) | devDependencies | patch | [`5.1.9` -> `5.1.10`](https://renovatebot.com/diffs/npm/@storybook%2ftheming/5.1.9/5.1.10) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>storybookjs/storybook</summary>\n\n### [`v5.1.10`](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;5110-July-31-2019)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/compare/v5.1.9...v5.1.10)\n\n##### Breaking Changes\n\n-   Core: Remove project root `babel.config.js` loading ([#&#8203;7573](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7573))\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Addon-info: change stylesheetBase info height from 110vh to 100vh ([#&#8203;7141](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7141))\n-   React-native: Fix react native server ([#&#8203;7187](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7187))\n-   Addon-centered/contexts: Move optionalDependencies to peerDependencies ([#&#8203;7315](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7315))\n-   Addon-notes/info: Fix indenting on markdown code blocks ([#&#8203;7158](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7158))\n-   Addon-actions: fix serialization performance ([#&#8203;7256](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7256))\n-   Addon-notes: Fix dark theming bug ([#&#8203;7623](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7623))\n-   CLI: Fix usage information ([#&#8203;7627](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7627))\n-   Addon-centered: Fix component disappearing on zoom ([#&#8203;7400](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7400))\n-   Addon-analytics: Fix API signature ([#&#8203;7410](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7410))\n-   UI: Fix Sidebar input refresh on 'Enter' ([#&#8203;7342](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7342))\n-   Addon-knobs: Prevent rerender when a button callback returns false. ([#&#8203;7197](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7197))\n-   Core: Keep story data and legacy data in sync ([#&#8203;7319](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7319))\n-   CLI: Move the free port logic so that loadOptions don't override it ([#&#8203;7237](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7237))\n-   Addon-backgrounds: Fix unstretched preview background wrapper ([#&#8203;7173](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7173))\n\n##### Maintenance\n\n-   Build: delete tests & snapshots from dist ([#&#8203;7358](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7358))\n\n##### Dependency Upgrades\n\n-   CLI: replaced merge-dirs dependency by fs-extra ([#&#8203;7100](https://togithub.com/storybookjs/storybook/pull/7100))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these updates again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
